  "battle_card_templates": {
    "vs_enterprise_global": "If you need Tinuiti/Wpromote-tier enterprise scale and budget isn't a constraint, they're excellent. If you want the same senior-level thinking at 30-50% of their cost with a written 90-day guarantee, that's where we beat them.",
    "vs_ppc_only_global": "KlientBoost/Disruptive are solid on PPC. We cover PPC equally well plus the tracking/CRM layer that makes PPC actually measurable post-iOS14. If PPC is all you need, hire the specialists; if you need the system around PPC, hire us.",
    "vs_dtc_ecom_global": "Pilothouse and CTC are great if you're already at $1M+/mo DTC with ad spend to match their minimums. Under that, we deliver the same playbook with more attention and a guarantee.",
    "vs_pk_enterprise_agencies": "Octillion/VentureDive/BrandSynario do beautiful brand work for the top 50 PK enterprises. If you need an acquisition-first, ROAS-obsessed partner with international reach, that's our lane.",
